cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use matsketch, please cite it as below, together with the papers for the methods you rely on."
type: software
title: "matsketch: Randomized Matrix Computations from Few Entries and Products"
abstract: >-
  An R implementation of randomly pivoted Cholesky, the XTrace, XNysTrace and
  XDiag estimators, and randomized Nystrom preconditioning, combined into a
  REML fit of genomic variance components that never forms the covariance
  matrix.
